{
  "story_id": "paper-makers-house",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 316320,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The box was heavier than she expected.",
      "start_ms": 2635,
      "end_ms": 5571
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "She lifted the lid.",
      "start_ms": 5571,
      "end_ms": 7077
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Inside, in a neat stack, were sheets of hanji.",
      "start_ms": 7077,
      "end_ms": 10615
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Not one or two — hundreds.",
      "start_ms": 10615,
      "end_ms": 12648
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The stack was maybe as thick as a large book.",
      "start_ms": 12648,
      "end_ms": 16111
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The sheets were pale cream, all the same size, all the standard size Harabeoji made.",
      "start_ms": 16111,
      "end_ms": 22510
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Each looked perfect — no torn edges, no water stains, no folded corners.",
      "start_ms": 22510,
      "end_ms": 28006
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Ji-eun lifted the top sheet gently and looked at the bottom right corner where the number always went.",
      "start_ms": 28006,
      "end_ms": 35836
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Nothing.",
      "start_ms": 35836,
      "end_ms": 36513
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "The corner was blank.",
      "start_ms": 36513,
      "end_ms": 38170
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "She lifted the next sheet.",
      "start_ms": 38170,
      "end_ms": 40202
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Blank.",
      "start_ms": 40202,
      "end_ms": 40729
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "The next — blank.",
      "start_ms": 40729,
      "end_ms": 42084
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "She kept going, gently, five sheets, ten sheets, all the way down.",
      "start_ms": 42084,
      "end_ms": 47129
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Not one of them was numbered.",
      "start_ms": 47129,
      "end_ms": 49387
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Not a single one.",
      "start_ms": 49387,
      "end_ms": 50742
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "She stared at the stack for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 50742,
      "end_ms": 53829
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Then she carried it, box and all, back across the rainy courtyard to the main house, and she waited for Harabeoji to come home.",
      "start_ms": 53829,
      "end_ms": 63541
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "He came in about an hour later.",
      "start_ms": 63541,
      "end_ms": 65950
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "He took off his wet hat and his wet shoes, one at a time, and only then looked into the room.",
      "start_ms": 65950,
      "end_ms": 73027
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "He saw the box on the table.",
      "start_ms": 73027,
      "end_ms": 75210
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "He saw Ji-eun holding up one of the sheets.",
      "start_ms": 75210,
      "end_ms": 78523
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "He did not say anything for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 78523,
      "end_ms": 81383
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Then he crossed the room slowly and sat down on the cushion across from her.",
      "start_ms": 81383,
      "end_ms": 87256
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "\"I did not know you would find those,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 87256,
      "end_ms": 90869
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "\"I had forgotten they were in the workshop.\" Ji-eun said, \"Harabeoji, they are not numbered.\" He nodded.",
      "start_ms": 90869,
      "end_ms": 98774
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "He was looking at the sheet she held.",
      "start_ms": 98774,
      "end_ms": 101635
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "He said, \"No.",
      "start_ms": 101635,
      "end_ms": 102689
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I did not number them.\"",
      "start_ms": 102689,
      "end_ms": 104571
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "He was quiet for a while.",
      "start_ms": 104571,
      "end_ms": 106529
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Ji-eun did not push.",
      "start_ms": 106529,
      "end_ms": 108110
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "She waited.",
      "start_ms": 108110,
      "end_ms": 109013
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He got up and made tea.",
      "start_ms": 109013,
      "end_ms": 110820
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "When he had poured them both cups, he sat down again.",
      "start_ms": 110820,
      "end_ms": 114885
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Then he said, \"Halmoni — your grandmother — died eight years ago.",
      "start_ms": 114885,
      "end_ms": 119854
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "You were three.",
      "start_ms": 119854,
      "end_ms": 121059
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "You do not really remember her.",
      "start_ms": 121059,
      "end_ms": 123468
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "She died in early June, that year.",
      "start_ms": 123468,
      "end_ms": 126103
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "The persimmon had just flowered.",
      "start_ms": 126103,
      "end_ms": 128587
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I stopped making paper for four months.",
      "start_ms": 128587,
      "end_ms": 131599
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "I could not work.",
      "start_ms": 131599,
      "end_ms": 132954
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I could not do anything, really.",
      "start_ms": 132954,
      "end_ms": 135438
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I sat in the house.\"",
      "start_ms": 135438,
      "end_ms": 136944
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "He drank some tea.",
      "start_ms": 136944,
      "end_ms": 138133
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "\"In October, I began again.",
      "start_ms": 138133,
      "end_ms": 139886
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "I do not know why October and not September.",
      "start_ms": 139886,
      "end_ms": 142703
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "It happens when it happens.",
      "start_ms": 142703,
      "end_ms": 144456
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "I made a sheet.",
      "start_ms": 144456,
      "end_ms": 145458
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "I dried it.",
      "start_ms": 145458,
      "end_ms": 146209
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I brought it in to number it.",
      "start_ms": 146209,
      "end_ms": 148087
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "And I found I did not know what to write.",
      "start_ms": 148087,
      "end_ms": 150716
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "I did not know what week it was.",
      "start_ms": 150716,
      "end_ms": 152782
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I did not know what season it was, in the sense the number keeps track of.",
      "start_ms": 152782,
      "end_ms": 157477
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Everything had shifted.",
      "start_ms": 157477,
      "end_ms": 158979
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "I had been counting my life a certain way, and that way had ended, and I did not yet know how the counting worked now.",
      "start_ms": 158979,
      "end_ms": 166429
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "So I put the sheet in a box, unnumbered.",
      "start_ms": 166429,
      "end_ms": 168995
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "And the next week I made another.",
      "start_ms": 168995,
      "end_ms": 171124
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "And I put it in the box, unnumbered.",
      "start_ms": 171124,
      "end_ms": 173440
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I made paper for a whole year like that.",
      "start_ms": 173440,
      "end_ms": 176007
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Then, the following autumn, one Tuesday, I sat down at the table and I picked up the brush and I wrote a number on a new sheet.",
      "start_ms": 176007,
      "end_ms": 184019
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Just — I was ready.",
      "start_ms": 184019,
      "end_ms": 185271
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I do not know why that Tuesday.",
      "start_ms": 185271,
      "end_ms": 187275
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "I have been numbering ever since.",
      "start_ms": 187275,
      "end_ms": 189403
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "But the year of unnumbered sheets I put away.",
      "start_ms": 189403,
      "end_ms": 192283
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I could not go back and number them.",
      "start_ms": 192283,
      "end_ms": 194599
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "It was too late.",
      "start_ms": 194599,
      "end_ms": 195663
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "It was the wrong kind of counting.\"",
      "start_ms": 195663,
      "end_ms": 197979
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Ji-eun listened.",
      "start_ms": 197979,
      "end_ms": 199043
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "She thought about it for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 199043,
      "end_ms": 201422
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Then she said, \"Harabeoji.",
      "start_ms": 201422,
      "end_ms": 203112
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "What if we numbered them now?",
      "start_ms": 203112,
      "end_ms": 204990
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Together.",
      "start_ms": 204990,
      "end_ms": 205616
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Not with the ordinary numbers.",
      "start_ms": 205616,
      "end_ms": 207557
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Something else.\" He looked at her.",
      "start_ms": 207557,
      "end_ms": 209811
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "\"What if,\" Ji-eun said, \"instead of a number and a season, we wrote a small thing on each one?",
      "start_ms": 209811,
      "end_ms": 215758
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "What was happening that week.",
      "start_ms": 215758,
      "end_ms": 217636
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Something small.",
      "start_ms": 217636,
      "end_ms": 218700
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "The weather.",
      "start_ms": 218700,
      "end_ms": 219514
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "What you ate.",
      "start_ms": 219514,
      "end_ms": 220390
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "What the persimmon was doing.",
      "start_ms": 220390,
      "end_ms": 222268
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Whether you slept well.",
      "start_ms": 222268,
      "end_ms": 223771
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Something.",
      "start_ms": 223771,
      "end_ms": 224459
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "So the sheet has a date but not a count.",
      "start_ms": 224459,
      "end_ms": 227026
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Because that year did not count like the other years, right?",
      "start_ms": 227026,
      "end_ms": 230844
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "But it still was.",
      "start_ms": 230844,
      "end_ms": 231971
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "It still happened.",
      "start_ms": 231971,
      "end_ms": 233161
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "The paper is still there.",
      "start_ms": 233161,
      "end_ms": 234788
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "So the paper can say — this week, it was raining.",
      "start_ms": 234788,
      "end_ms": 237918
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Or this week, my daughter called.",
      "start_ms": 237918,
      "end_ms": 240047
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Or this week, I finally finished the book Halmoni had been reading.",
      "start_ms": 240047,
      "end_ms": 244303
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Something.\"",
      "start_ms": 244303,
      "end_ms": 244992
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Harabeoji was still.",
      "start_ms": 244992,
      "end_ms": 246302
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He did not interrupt her.",
      "start_ms": 246302,
      "end_ms": 247925
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "When she stopped, he looked at the box.",
      "start_ms": 247925,
      "end_ms": 250421
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "He looked at the small pot of ink on the table.",
      "start_ms": 250421,
      "end_ms": 253417
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Then he looked at Ji-eun.",
      "start_ms": 253417,
      "end_ms": 255039
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "He said, quietly, \"You are eleven years old and that is a wise idea.",
      "start_ms": 255039,
      "end_ms": 259345
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I would never have thought of it.",
      "start_ms": 259345,
      "end_ms": 261467
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 261467,
      "end_ms": 261779
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Let us do that.\"",
      "start_ms": 261779,
      "end_ms": 262902
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "They started that same evening.",
      "start_ms": 262902,
      "end_ms": 264899
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Harabeoji got the small pot of ink and the small brush.",
      "start_ms": 264899,
      "end_ms": 268394
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "He took the top sheet from the box and set it on the low table.",
      "start_ms": 268394,
      "end_ms": 272387
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "He looked at Ji-eun.",
      "start_ms": 272387,
      "end_ms": 273698
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "He said, \"You do not remember your grandmother.",
      "start_ms": 273698,
      "end_ms": 276693
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "So I will tell you about her, one week at a time, one sheet at a time.",
      "start_ms": 276693,
      "end_ms": 281124
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "It will take us many nights.",
      "start_ms": 281124,
      "end_ms": 282934
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Perhaps all your two weeks here.",
      "start_ms": 282934,
      "end_ms": 284993
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Perhaps not all — there are more than fifty sheets.",
      "start_ms": 284993,
      "end_ms": 288238
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "But we will do what we can.",
      "start_ms": 288238,
      "end_ms": 289985
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "When you go home, you will know something about her that you did not know when you came.\"",
      "start_ms": 289985,
      "end_ms": 295664
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "He picked up the brush.",
      "start_ms": 295664,
      "end_ms": 297162
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "He thought for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 297162,
      "end_ms": 298722
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Then he wrote, in his careful small hand, at the bottom of the sheet: October, first week.",
      "start_ms": 298722,
      "end_ms": 304401
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "It rained every day.",
      "start_ms": 304401,
      "end_ms": 305711
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "She had liked October rain.",
      "start_ms": 305711,
      "end_ms": 307459
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He set the brush down.",
      "start_ms": 307459,
      "end_ms": 308894
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "He was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 308894,
      "end_ms": 310579
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Then he passed the sheet to Ji-eun.",
      "start_ms": 310579,
      "end_ms": 312825
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "He said, \"You put it aside to dry.",
      "start_ms": 312825,
      "end_ms": 315010
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Then we do the next.\"",
      "start_ms": 315010,
      "end_ms": 316320
    }
  ]
}